\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. God loved the world of sinners lost
\par And ruined by the fall;
\par Salvation full, at highest cost,
\par He offers free to all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O 'twas love, 'twas wondrous love!
\par The love of God to me;
\par It brought my Saviour from above,
\par To die on Calvary.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. E'en now by faith I claim Him mine,
\par The risen Son of God;
\par Redemption by His death I find,
\par And cleansing through the blood.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O 'twas love, 'twas wondrous love!
\par The love of God to me;
\par It brought my Saviour from above,
\par To die on Calvary.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Love brings the glorious fullness in,
\par And to His saints makess known
\par The blessed rest from inbred sin,
\par Through faith in Christ alone.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O 'twas love, 'twas wondrous love!
\par The love of God to me;
\par It brought my Saviour from above,
\par To die on Calvary.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Believing souls, rejoicing go;
\par There shall to yoube given
\par A glorious foretaste, here below,
\par Of endless life in heaven.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Of victory now o'er Satan's power
\par Let all the ransomed sing,
\par And triumph in the dying hour
\par Through Christ, the Lord, our King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O 'twas love, 'twas wondrous love!
\par The love of God to me;
\par It brought my Saviour from above,
\par To die on Calvary.
\par \f1 
